  ;; W3C Verifiable Credentials with real Data Integrity proofs
  ;; (ADR-2607309400). org-w3-vc validates a credential's SHAPE and treats
  ;; `proof` as an opaque pass-through, so it is deliberately absent here: it
  ;; would add no signature. These four are what make a membership claim
  ;; verifiable outside this process.
  ;; advanced for data-integrity.ecdsa (ecdsa-jcs-2019, P-256). The previous pin
  ;; had Ed25519 only, so every P-256 credential -- which is every WebAuthn
  ;; subject -- was refused with a message saying P-256 was unsupported. It is
  ;; supported now, and that message was the last thing making it untrue.
  io.github.kotoba-lang/org-w3-vc-data-integrity
  {:git/url "https://github.com/kotoba-lang/org-w3-vc-data-integrity.git"
   :git/sha "37ccc89cb75296020d8dc7df6436399fc147f026"}
  ;; The -rdfc- tower. Present so the credential's own tests can prove that its
  ;; claims survive RDF canonicalization -- the failure this context exists to
  ;; prevent is invisible under JCS.
  io.github.kotoba-lang/org-w3-json-ld-api
  {:git/url "https://github.com/kotoba-lang/org-w3-json-ld-api.git"
   :git/sha "499a2223f62ef497991c341b57c4848b41730b2c"}
  io.github.kotoba-lang/org-w3-rdf-canon
  {:git/url "https://github.com/kotoba-lang/org-w3-rdf-canon.git"
   :git/sha "a869606344be6d6612745bb860f630602f33e32b"}
  ;; OID4VP, Verifier side only. The Wallet side needs a holder key that can sign
  ;; over a Verifier-supplied nonce, and a Passkey cannot -- it signs its own
  ;; authenticatorData || clientDataHash. So this app can ASK for presentations
  ;; and check the envelope that comes back; it cannot produce one.
  ;; SD-JWT VC (draft-ietf-oauth-sd-jwt-vc), for membership credentials whose
  ;; SUBJECT can be withheld. The W3C VC + Data Integrity path in
  ;; `credential` discloses everything in the credential to whoever sees it; this
  ;; one lets a holder prove "someone at this organization is an auditor" without
  ;; revealing which did:key they are, which is unlinkability across verifiers.
  io.github.kotoba-lang/org-ietf-sd-jwt-vc
  {:git/url "https://github.com/kotoba-lang/org-ietf-sd-jwt-vc.git"
   :git/sha "9d85bfb0473a50a7d31eab39c12dbd0b1ed1bd51"}
